{"id": null, "n": "0651008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0651008", "type": "orig", "text": "印＋（讚岐守傳安然）夾註【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0651009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0651009", "type": "orig", "text": "〔言〕－【甲】"}
